            <div xml:id="d883">

                <pb facs="0848" n="744" xml:id="pg744"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/6406.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Consul at
                            Nogales to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Nogales</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-02-27T14:00:00-07:23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 27, 1913—2 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Rebel forces gathering in eastern Sonora to oppose Huerta Government. Situation
                    of Americans may become serious if railway communication is discontinued.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Simpich</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
